<h2>About Gift of the Givers</h2>

<p>The Gift of the Givers Foundation is the largest disaster relief organisation in Africa. Established in 1992, we provide:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Emergency food, water, and shelter</li>
    <li>Medical teams and supplies</li>
    <li>Search and rescue operations</li>
    <li>Long-term rebuilding of communities</li>
</ul>
<p>Our team of volunteers and experts operates in South Africa and across the world, responding to natural disasters, conflict zones, and humanitarian crises.</p>